00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.650
Sawaragi-san. It can't be helped.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.320
But, still...

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:11.210
Did you really know about all that?

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.710
Well, yeah.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:16.000
Not everything, but I did know about it.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.500
Shortly after we got into high school,

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:23.590
I saw Yutori surrounded by some 
students from another school.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:28.720
Obviously, I defended her.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:31.390
But right when I tried
to take Yutori and run...

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.020
one of them said...

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.150
She ain't worth protecting.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.730
A chick like that'll do anything for cash.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.990
I was worried, so I asked,

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:47.910
and she told me she did 
compensated dating in junior high.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:52.790
I didn't want to dig any deeper, 
and promised I wouldn't tell anyone.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:56.290
I asked if she wanted to be friends.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.590
I never break my promises to my friends!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:05.050
I know. Even when you were little,
 you were the same way.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:06.430
Mikasa-kun...

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.050
You've always been 
straightforward and honest,

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.060
and you always put your friends first.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.930
I believe you.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.770
Thank you for believing me, Tenji-san!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.480
No problem!

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.650
We're childhood buddies. 
I know you better than anyone!

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:24.150
Yeah.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.540
Wow!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.870
Everything's getting messy 
in so many ways!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.000
It is.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:39.000
And it turns out we do have one.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.380
"One" what?

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:45.380
A human who's deliberately trying to destroy 
the friendships in this group, of course.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:51.350
Maybe that one didn't start the Tomodachi Game 
to bury the others in debt.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:55.230
The true goal might be to destroy 
the friendships between the five of them.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.230
<b>No</b>

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:59.150
In that case, do you think
 Shibe's the most suspicious?

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:03.110
He was obviously jealous of the relationship 
between Yuichi-kun and Shiho-chan,

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.070
and now he's off sulking all by himself.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.530
He certainly does appear to be wealthy,

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:12.950
so he would probably prioritize love 
and friendship over money.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.790
Right?

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:18.330
And the next most suspicious
 one is Tenji-kun.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:22.170
It looks like he didn't know about 
Yutori-chan's compensated dating,

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.840
but I bet he <i>did</i> know that 
Shiho-chan likes Yuichi-kun,

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.930
and that she'd had plastic surgery before.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.840
If you think about it from that perspective,

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.300
isn't there someone who's 
even more suspicious?

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:36.680
Huh? Even more... suspicious?

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:37.980
Oh!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.650
It's Shiho-chan!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.520
She knew about the compensated dating, 
her own time dating Tenji-kun,

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:46.400
and of course, her own
 feelings for Yuichi-kun.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:51.660
Yeah. It's possible to bad-mouth 
yourself on a bad-mouth card.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:56.330
In that case, Shiho-chan <i>is</i>
 the most suspicious after all.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.460
Conversely, if you think about
 what happened in the first game,

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.130
we can't let Katagiri Yuichi 
off the hook yet.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:06.960
Either way, it seems like 
Yutori-chan is the most unlikely,

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.720
especially after all that crying.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:13.800
<i>Break...</i>

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:16.890
<i>Break...</i>

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:19.520
<i>Break...</i>

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.060
<i>Break...</i>

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.820
<i>Break!</i>

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:29.900
<i>Break!</i>

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.990
<i>You'll break into pieces!</i>

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:38.290
<i>That's why I stole the two million yen.</i>

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.460
<b></b>Independent Study!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.840
Hey, guys. You all turned in 
your class trip fee, right?

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.210
Oh, really?

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.380
That's so crazy!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.680
Hey, everyone!

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.430
It's independent study time, not free time!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.100
Can't you be a little quieter?

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:57.390
Who cares?

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.020
You're the loudest one here, Sawaragi.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.560
Huh? Quit nitpicking,

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.360
or I'll beat you up!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.820
You already did.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:11.110
I need to hurry over to the teachers' room.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.070
Class Trip Funds Collection Envelope
Class 2-A, Sawaragi Shiho

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.160
Hey, Shiho.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:15.950
Huh?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.120
Matsuda-sensei's calling for you.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.540
You need to go to the third floor 
multimedia room now.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:23.460
Huh? That's totally 
in the opposite direction.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:24.580
Right now?

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.670
It sounds like it.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.000
Class Trip Funds Collection Envelope
Class 2-A, Sawaragi Shiho

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.000
Class Trip Fund

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.130
<b>Sawaragi</b>

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:38.390
Oh, well.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.470
I won't be gone long.

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:43.390
<b>Sawaragi</b>

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:50.360
<b>Sawaragi</b>

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:50.360
<b>Itami</b>

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.700
Hey, man, would you let me 
copy your math homework?

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:00.160
Huh? Ask Katagiri. You're friends, right?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.460
Yuichi? No way.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:07.040
He's been working his butt off. Look at him.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.250
You wouldn't wanna wake him up, would you?

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.420
Fine, then. Here.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:12.920
Math

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.300
Oh! Thank you!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:17.340
Hey, guys! I need to concentrate!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:18.760
Don't talk to me!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.470
No one was gonna, trust me.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.280
Ow, ow, ow...

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.780
Sorry, Kokorogi-san.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.240
No, it was my fault.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:37.280
Oh!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.450
Kokorogi-san, are you okay?

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:46.500
Y-Yeah, I'm fine! Don't worry about me!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:53.090
Um, did... you see?

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.760
You did, didn't you?

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:00.300
I've been drawing manga.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:05.350
I don't have ambitions to 
become a pro, or anything.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:09.150
I just have a really active imagination,

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:12.020
and I wanted to try drawing 
it out, since I love manga.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:16.150
I was keeping it a secret, but now you know.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:19.910
Oh, sorry! I talk too much.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.030
Were you doing something?

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:23.740
<b>Sawaragi</b>

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.790
It's okay. I'm already done.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:30.080
Oh, you're bleeding near your eye!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:35.300
I-I'm sorry! My fountain pen went flying 
and must have cut you.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:38.590
You'd better get it treated 
or it might leave a scar.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.760
It's okay. I don't think anyone will notice.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:55.610
<i>Oh, man. What a nasty
 face you're making, Shibe!</i>

00:18:56.190 --> 00:19:01.450
<i>When you found out the girl you like had 
plastic surgery, did you lose interest?</i>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>Q: Who is the most "unforgivable"?</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>Shibe Makoto</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>Sawaragi Shiho</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>Katagiri Yuichi</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>Kokorogi Yutori</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>Mikasa Tenji</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>no kidding...</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>is she that desperate to be popular?</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>say it isn't so, Shiho-sama lol</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>plastic surgery, of course</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>she would, wouldn't she?</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>she left them in the dust</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>that's just sad</b>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
<b>Shiho-samaaa</b>

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.830
<i>Well, she </i>did<i> get plastic surgery, 
but it wasn't cosmetic.</i>

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:09.370
<i>She had to do it to cover the 
 facial scar she got in junior high.</i>

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:16.550
<i>I'm the only one who knows the truth.</i>

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:17.380
<b>Actually, Sawaragi Shiho</b>

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:17.380
<b>has had plastic surgery.</b>

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.050
<b>Bad-Mouth</b>

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.050
<b></b>Actually, Sawaragi Shiho 
has had plastic surgery.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.050
<i>And the person who wrote that, of course,</i>

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.390
<i>is me.</i>

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.510
<i>It's not just that, either.</i>

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:28.560
<i>I know it all. Everything.</i>

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.350
Did you see the TV drama?

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.020
Oh, I haven't seen it,
 so don't spoil anything.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:35.980
See you later.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:36.730
Bye!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:47.080
<i>Because I was always watching.</i>

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:53.710
<b>Sawaragi</b>

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:53.710
<b>Itami</b>

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.120
<i>I know where you kept 
your spare locker key...</i>

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.090
An anti-theft alarm?

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.720
Thanks! I'll keep it on my bag.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.470
<i>Because I was always listening.</i>

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:07.350
That's why... That's why I...

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.600
I had to start compensated dating...

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.980
Don't worry. I promise to keep it a secret.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.650
<i>Even private conversations...</i>

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.030
Oh, is that a cut?

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:23.240
You'd better treat it or it'll leave a scar.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.070
Take those off and show me.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.620
Yeah, that's definitely a cut.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.920
My fountain pen went flying 
and must have cut you.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.960
You'd better get it treated.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.090
<i>It's okay. I don't think anyone will notice.</i>

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.880
Yeah, maybe.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:51.980
Break... Break... Break...

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:57.480
<i>Shiho-chan's relationships 
will all break into pieces!</i>

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:01.650
<i>And when you're left alone, all by yourself,</i>

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.490
<i>I'll say sweet things to you.</i>

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:10.040
<i>And then, Shiho-chan, how will you react?</i>

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.870
<i>What will you say to me then?</i>

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:19.130
<i>Just imagining it makes me... makes me so...</i>

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:23.880
<b>NEXT: Seriously? That's So Cringe!</b>
